## Platform Integration Points

### 1. AppSec Dashboard (`AppSecDashboard.tsx`)
- Displays findings from `getDemoFindings()`
- Filters by app, severity, category, status
- Shows real AppScan data for demo.testfire.net

### 2. Risk Scores API (`/api/v1/risks`)
- `getDemoRiskScores()` includes demo.testfire.net
- Fused score drives risk visualization

### 3. Public Summary (`/api/v1/public-summary`)
- Aggregates findings across all apps
- Includes AppScan connector health status

